      "title": "Scope",
      "content": "Scope: This Indian Standard (IS 15622 : 2017) covers and specifies requirements for Pressed Ceramic Tiles - Specification (First Revision). It applies to ceramic_tiles under tiles_ceramics category in the construction_civil domain.",
